# Tunnel executables, fetched by the downloadTunnelBinaries Gradle task from the release
# produced by .github/workflows/tunnel-binaries.yml. NOT committed: they were ~40 MB of
# unverifiable prebuilt blobs (UPX-packed, three with the PackHeader stripped so they
# could not even be unpacked for inspection). They are digest-pinned in app/build.gradle.kts.
/app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libtailscale.so
/app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libcloudflared.so
/app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libzrok.so
/app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libsingbox.so
# libod.so is no longer committed: its math was reimplemented in open Kotlin
# (BsCoefficients, PR #8), so the blob is gone.
/app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libod.so

# Legal notices, copied into the APK by the copyLegalAssets Gradle task from the repo-root
# THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and LICENSES/. Generated at build time — not committed.
/app/src/main/assets/web/local/legal/

